  <p class="footnote" style="margin-bottom:0;">Weekday mix counts how many pipeline families asked for each day, from every expected start recorded on or after <%= dLong(coe.pipeline_from) %> (no month cut-off), so one family appears in as many columns as the days they asked for. A family whose requested days are not recorded is counted in the child-days above, at the centre's mean requested days per week, but cannot appear in the mix. Child-days before a centre's opening month are start dates recorded ahead of the opening in LineLeader, not an error — they are shown as recorded. Park Rd (2028) is excluded: it opens well beyond this window.</p>
</div>
